  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_UnfulfilledAgreementsRelatingToTheAcquisitionOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAndIntangibleAssetsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(2) 보고기간종료일 현재 발생하지 않은 유ㆍ무형자산의 취득을 위한 약정액은 9,783,549백만원입니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_LoanFacilitiesWithAccountsReceivablePledgedAsCollateralAndOtherFinancialAgreementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">우리은행 등 13개 은행과 한도액 2,149,320백만원의 외상매출채권담보대출, 일반대출 등의 약정을 맺고 있습니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_TradeFinancingAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">이외에도 연결회사는 신한은행 등 23개 은행과 한도액 15,958,875백만원의 무역금융 약정을 체결하고 있으며,</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_TradeFinancingAgreementsTradeNotesReceivableDiscountingFacilitiesAndLoanFacilitiesWithAccountsReceivablePledgedAsCollateralMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(1) 보고기간종료일 현재 연결회사는 우리은행 등 28개 은행과 무역금융, 상업어음할인 및 외상매출채권담보대출 등의 약정을 맺고 있으며 동 약정에 대한 통합한도액은 21,762,600백만원입니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
