  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfFinancialLiabilitiesExposedToLiquidityRiskOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForFinancialLiabilitiesAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간종료일 현재 상기 금융부채 외 지급보증 및 이행보증 등으로 노출된 유동성위험은 없습니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfFinancialLiabilitiesExposedToLiquidityRiskOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalysisForFinancialLiabilitiesAbstractTableOfItems>
