  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationOtherProvisions contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfProvisionsAxis_entity00126380_EmployeerelatedprovisionsmemberOfOtherProvisionsMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherProvisionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 임원을 대상으로 부여연도를 포함한 향후 3년간의 경영실적에 따라 성과급을 지급하는 장기성과 인센티브를 부여하였는 바, 향후 지급이 예상되는 금액의 경과 기간 해당분을 충당부채로 계상하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationOtherProvisions>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationOtherProvisions contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfProvisionsAxis_entity00126380_ProvisionforlicensefeesmemberOfOtherProvisionsMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherProvisionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 협상 진행 중인 기술사용계약과 관련하여 향후 지급이 예상되는 기술사용료를 추정하여 충당부채로 계상하고 있습니다. 지급시기 및 금액은 협상결과에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationOtherProvisions>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationOtherProvisions contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfProvisionsAxis_ifrs-full_WarrantyProvisionMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 출고한 제품에 대한 품질보증, 교환, 하자보수 및 그에 따른 사후서비스 등으로 인하여 향후 부담할 것으로 예상되는 비용을 보증기간 및 과거 경험률 등을 기초로 추정하여 충당부채로 설정하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationOtherProvisions>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_JointLiabilitiesRelatedToTheDivestitureMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">다. 분할과 관련된 연대채무
회사와 삼성디스플레이㈜ 등은 분할된 삼성디스플레이㈜ 등의 분할 전 채무에 관하여 연대하여 변제할 책임이 있습니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:ActualIndebtednessOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_DebtGuaranteesOthersMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">0</entity00126380:ActualIndebtednessOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_UnfulfilledAgreementsRelatingToTheAcquisitionOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAndIntangibleAssetsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(2) 보고기간종료일 현재 발생하지 않은 유ㆍ무형자산의 취득을 위한 약정액은 6,962,653백만원입니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_TradeFinancingAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">이외에도 회사는 신한은행 외 18개 은행과 한도액 US$ 8,908백만의 무역금융 약정을 체결하고 있으며,</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_TradeFinancingAgreementsTradeNotesReceivableDiscountingFacilitiesAndLoanFacilitiesWithAccountsReceivablePledgedAsCollateralMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(1) 보고기간종료일 현재 회사는 우리은행 외 4개 은행과 무역금융, 상업어음할인 및 외상매출채권담보대출 등의 약정을 맺고 있으며 동 약정에 대한 통합한도액은 10,440,914백만원입니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_CollateralOrGuaranteesProvidedFromItsRelatedPartiesMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(3) 보고기간종료일 현재 회사가 특수관계자로부터 제공받고 있는 담보 및 지급보증은 없습니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfTheAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
  <entity00126380:GuaranteedAmountForeignCurrencyOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2023dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_entity00126380_TypesOfCommitmentsAxisOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractOfAxis_entity00126380_TradeFinancingAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">US$ 8,908백만</entity00126380:GuaranteedAmountForeignCurrencyOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsAbstractTableOfItems>
